  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dhiraagu Telecommunication Connectivity Enhancement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project involves partially funding Dhiraagu&amp;apos;s investment capital expenditures (CAPEX) and working capital requirements.

The proposed CAPEX will enhance connectivity and improve telecoms services in Maldives. These comprise data center expansion, service extension and coverage enhancement, and installation and/or upgrade of network system equipment. These investments will boost connectivity in Maldives and improve the services provided by Dhiraagu.</narrative>
  </description>
